WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Take a charged rod and
bend it into a half circle.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.780
Ask for the electric field
at its central point,

3
00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:09.080
and you're in for a lot of work.

4
00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.880
Every piece pushes in
a different direction.

5
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:15.560
Components must be
resolved, piece by piece.

6
00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:19.820
Ask for the potential at the same
point, and the job is far easier.

7
00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.230
Why is that?

8
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:25.810
In this mission, you'll build up the
potential from tiny pieces of charge.

9
00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.160
Then you'll find the potential
near a straight charged rod,

10
00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.530
on its line and beside it.

11
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.920
Your mission: explain why the potential
at the half circle's central point is

12
00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.410
so easy to find.
